{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"11":"The Rites of Hajj (Kitab Al-Manasik Wa'l-Hajj)"},"section_detail":{"11":{"hadithnumber_first":1721,"hadithnumber_last":2045,"arabicnumber_first":1721,"arabicnumber_last":2045,"name_native":"كتاب المناسك والحج"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2044,"arabicnumber":2044,"text":"حدثنا القعنبي، عن مالك، عن نافع، عن عبد الله بن عمر، ان رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم اناخ بالبطحاء التي بذي الحليفة فصلى بها فكان عبد الله بن عمر يفعل ذلك","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (1532) Sahih Muslim (1257 After  1345)"}],"reference":{"book":11,"hadith":324}}]}